{
  "bookId": "hero-211001",
  "id": "bond-29302",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29302001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你……你怎么在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "莉可不愿意等我，那我就只能来这里等你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "唔……你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈，开个玩笑~这次我呢，是来赔礼道歉的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "赔……礼道歉？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "上次好像惹到莉可不开心了，所以……这个就算是赔礼了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "这个……是给我的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，莉可魔王大人还满意吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我……哼，虽然没我磨坊堡大，不过还算是勉勉强强吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你喜欢就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我才没有说喜欢……不过，算了，你觉得是就是吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那莉可算是原谅我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "我又没有生气，本王的心胸可比你想象的宽广。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "看在你送给本王一份还算不错的礼物份上……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29302015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "之后你来找我，本王都可以勉强浪费点时间陪陪你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
